<div id="choose-your-boat" class="mt-12 lg:mt-0 lg:max-w-[1400px] lg:mx-auto lg:px-10 lg:py-16 px-5">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8"><div class="w-1 h-6 bg-gold rounded-full"></div><h3 class="text-lg lg:text-2xl text-navy">Explora nuestros barcos — encuentra el ideal para tu experiencia al atardecer</h3></div>

